HST Office: "Tìm tính năng" at the top of the ribbon's ≡ menu; Draw's ≡ menu gets the two missing items.

Audit 13/11 (≡ button): at 1100 px the feature search box of the tab row is only a magnifier, so
the ≡ menu of Writer, Sheets, Slides and Draw starts with "Tìm tính năng" (its shortcut shows beside it; Alt+Q on Windows and Linux)
(.uno:CommandPopup, the command of the box, Shift+Esc and Alt+Q), followed by a separator. Draw's
≡ menu had five items; it gets "Báo lỗi cho HASON TECH" (org.hst.office.vi:ReportError) and
"Kiểm tra cập nhật HST Office" (org.hst.office.update:Check) after the help item, so all four
apps have the same items in the same order. Labels are Vietnamese in every UI language, like the
other HST items of this menu.

